          "content": "## Container preparation only\nGitHub API + GitHub Actions. No host access. No image build, pull, tagging, restart or live-container tests.\nA new OpenClaw OR Hermes release opens the gate. Always capture and test BOTH latest Ephemeral commits.\nReturn READY_FOR_BUILD and its commit to Hermes. Further steps belong to the user/Hermes. Compatibility failures stop; source repairs require explicit Go.",
